# --- board artifacts over the 50 MB commit cap ---
# rootfs.tar.gz is needed to write a card and is kept in the tree. The PYNQ
# sdist is not kept at all -- only the wheel built from it is installed -- but
# the rebuild recipe re-downloads it here, so guard against committing it.
# See deploy/README.md.
/deploy/boot/rootfs.tar.gz
/deploy/pynq_offline/pynq-3.0.1.tar.gz
